Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","review_id":"rSATovbwyWhFj8syY-ej6g","date":"2019-01-02T22:46:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.924522876739502,"text_excerpt":"My first time eating raising canes was in Ohio and I fell in love. The chicken tenders are just that tender. The cane sauce is amazing and the lemonade taste like the lemonade from the state fair. I love this place. If you order the caniac box, you can sub fries for your coleslaw. The location was clean and friendly. I received my food quickly"},{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","review_id":"7M6WA8ceUmbwEv2IWg3TSg","date":"2016-01-22T16:24:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9146518707275391,"text_excerpt":"Raising Cane's is like that sweet mid tier between your typical grody fast food chain (cough McDonald's cough) and a reputable diner. They're good at what they do (cane's sauce, chicken strips), cheap, and fast. My only con for this place is that twice in a row, I've gotten stale fries from the drive thru. Other that that, this Cane's is pretty on par with the all the others."},{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","review_id":"hYhWLzZag1g89cLohWXHdA","date":"2018-06-29T06:16:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9082332253456116,"text_excerpt":"I'm usually a Cane's lover but the lemonade was pretty watery tonight. Other than that, everything was great. I love the service here and the food is always hot + delicious."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","photo_id":"JZtbLDNBxc-RZw5loRh0tQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JZtbLDNBxc-RZw5loRh0tQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9142168760299683},{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","photo_id":"oYTkvkauCzP_R-YQqbx8dA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/oYTkvkauCzP_R-YQqbx8dA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8971880674362183},{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","photo_id":"-Eeb5NPBYIKYICrU8Y3u_g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-Eeb5NPBYIKYICrU8Y3u_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8954541683197021},{"business_id":"N6Wo9LW3MDLzj7BxDdzESw","photo_id":"4RujHTp0a9ZkjVhhs8IEMQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4RujHTp0a9ZkjVhhs8IEMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8275576829910278}]},"notebook_case":null}
